stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> AtOutlet : restock, remainingDays = shelf life
    AtOutlet --> AtOutlet : night, remainingDays - 1
    AtOutlet --> Sold : remainingDays above 1 and household buys
    AtOutlet --> Trash : remainingDays at most 0
    Sold --> InFridge : category needs fridge and space left
    Sold --> OutsideFridge : no fridge needed, or fridge full
    InFridge --> OutsideFridge : overflow at storing time, shelf life scaled
    InFridge --> LastDay : remainingDays at most 1
    OutsideFridge --> LastDay : remainingDays at most 1
    InFridge --> Eaten
    OutsideFridge --> Eaten
    LastDay --> Eaten : eaten first by No spoil weirdo
    LastDay --> Trash : night, remainingDays at most 0
    Eaten --> [*]
    Trash --> [*] : trashbin emptied at start of next step
